-- Lambda: anonymous function assigned to variable
double is a function of x that returns x * 2
display double(5)

-- Lambda called directly (indirect call)
square is a function of x that returns x * x
display square(4)

-- Pass named function to map
numbers is [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
display map double over numbers

-- Inline lambda with map
display map (a function of x that returns x * 10) over numbers

-- Filter with named predicate
is-even is a function of x that returns x % 2 == 0
display filter numbers where is-even

-- Keep items (natural phrasing)
display keep items from numbers where is-even

-- Reduce (fold)
adder is a function of x and y that returns x + y
total is reduce numbers using adder starting at 0
display total

-- Map chained with filter
large is a function of x that returns x > 10
big-doubled is filter (map double over numbers) where large
display big-doubled

-- Named function also works as map target
function triple taking x, return x * 3.
display map triple over numbers

-- Transform natural phrasing
display transform every item in numbers using double

display "All functional tests passed"
